# OS & System Junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.log

# Node toolchain
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.npm/

# powerbi-visuals-tools generated & build output
# .api/ is the API surface the toolchain writes for the declared apiVersion; dist/ and
# .tmp/ are build output. All three are regenerated by npm install / pbiviz package and
# must never be hand-edited (CLAUDE.md Hard Rule #12).
.api/
.tmp/
dist/
webpack.statistics.*.html

# The released binary belongs to its tag, not to the working tree (Hard Rule #13): attach
# dist/<VisualName>.pbiviz to the GitHub release for vX.Y.Z. Without a git remote, copy it
# to releases/vX.Y.Z/ and commit that instead — one traceable binary per version.
# releases/ is deliberately NOT ignored, so that route works with no edit here.

# Dev certificate material — machine-local, and never shared
*.pfx
*.cer
*.key
certs/

# Claude Code personal overrides
.claude/settings.local.json

# OneDrive sync conflict copies
# If this repo lives in a OneDrive-synced folder, editing it from two machines produces
# stale duplicates of tracked files (e.g. visual-<account>.ts). They must never be committed.
# Uncomment and fill in your own OneDrive account suffix the first time one appears:
# *-<your-onedrive-account>.*
*conflicted copy*
